## Approved diagnosis
`createFakeStream()` (`test/m6b/m6b-runtime.contract.ts:6625-6651`) offers `message()/flags()/submit()` only; the runtime's
routed STREAM send terminal is `stream.send(rid).message(...).submit_sync()` (`node-raw-mesh-backend.ts:1997-2004`, per the
node binding spec's sync/awaitable terminal pair). The `TypeError` is caught and surfaces as a local `protocolError` →
`SubmitResult.InvalidState(8)`. Class A (test double behind the 0.17 binding terminal contract). Owner: test fixture.
Parity: cpp/dotnet/java m6b equivalents pass.

